# Homestead defaults for KDE Frameworks apps (Kate, Konsole, Dolphin, Gwenview...), installed as
# /etc/xdg/kdeglobals. KDE apps take their colours from kdeglobals itself, not from the scheme file, so the
# Homestead.colors sections are repeated here. A ~/.config/kdeglobals (Artix's skel ships one) overrides it.
